{'symbol': 'A', 'date': '2022-11-21 16:05:00', 'title': 'AGILENT REPORTS FOURTH-QUARTER AND FISCAL YEAR 2022 FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--AGILENT TECHNOLOGIES INC. (NYSE: A) TODAY REPORTED REVENUE OF $1.85 BILLION FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER ENDED OCT. 31, 2022, AN INCREASE OF 11% COMPARED TO THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2021 AND UP 17% ON A CORE(1) BASIS. REVENUE FOR THE FULL YEAR WAS $6.85 BILLION, DELIVERING 8% REPORTED GROWTH AND CORE(1) GROWTH OF 12%.'}